[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SOUTHERN_HARBOUR]
Southern Harbour

[en.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SOUTHERN_HARBOUR_desc]
After getting the Applewood, we finally have a southern port. Now we can participate in the naval competition in the South Luna Ocean.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SOUTHERN_HARBOUR]
南部港湾

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SEA_SOUTHERN_HARBOUR_desc]
拿下苹果坞后，我们终于拥有了一个南方的出海口。这样，我们也终于可以名正言顺地参与到南露娜洋的海军竞争中了。

